|------|------|
| TIA | V21 |
| CPU / MLFB | <!-- 例：6ES7 511-… --> |
| Station | <!-- 例：line-a-tap --> |
| 本機專案檔 | <!-- 例：D:\tia\line-a-tap\line-a-tap.ap21 --> |
| **openness-standard 根目錄** | <!-- 例：C:\Users\…\pioneerm-automation\openness-standard --> |
| 主計劃 | [`plan/project_scope.md`](plan/project_scope.md) |

